{"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/worldsnapshot"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Saving and Loading Worlds","generated":true,"anchor":"Saving-and-Loading-Worlds","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistryError","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistryLookupError","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/MapEntities"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WorldSnapshot"},{"kind":"text","text":"<each "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" repeat each "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"text":"Decodable","preciseIdentifier":"s:Se","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Encodable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SE","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9ComponentP","text":"Component","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use a snapshot to save a world and restore it later, or to compare two worlds. A snapshot","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is ","type":"text"},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so you can encode it with any encoder, such as ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSONEncoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Take one with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/snapshot(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":", listing the component types to save, and rebuild a world from it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ","type":"text"},{"code":"World(restoring:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Each component type you save must conform to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example saves a world as JSON and restores it:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","","var world = World()","let ship = world.spawn(Position(x: 1, y: 2), Health(current: 3))","let data = try JSONEncoder().encode(world.snapshot(Position.self, Health.self))","","let decoded = try JSONDecoder().decode(WorldSnapshot<Position, Health>.self, from: data)","let restored = World(restoring: decoded)","print(restored[Position.self, of: ship])","\/\/ Prints \"Position(x: 1.0, y: 2.0)\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every entity handle, live or stale, means the same in the restored world as in the original,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so handles you saved elsewhere stay valid. The restored world also hands out the same handles","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from later spawns.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A snapshot holds no resources, hooks or change ticks, and the restored world’s components"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are all added at its first tick. To save resources too, or to save a world without listing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its types at each call, use a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Decoding throws "},{"code":"DecodingError.dataCorrupted","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for data that no world could have"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"produced, such as a component of an entity that isn’t live."}]}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/init(from:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/count"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/encode(to:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/Equatable-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"WorldSnapshot","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"externalID":"s:11WorldModule0A8SnapshotV","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"WorldSnapshot","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WorldSnapshot","kind":"identifier"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Snapshot.sw